Max-iPhone18ProMax", "iPhoneDuo-iPhoneDuo"], "features":["iosUniversal"], "advisories":[], "kind":"software", "trackCensoredName":"Dino Fun - Dinosaurs!", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dino-fun-dinosaurs/id839685715?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.179140000000000298996383207850158214569091796875, "minimumOsVersion":"12.0", "sellerUrl":"http://playnlearnapps.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"111977472", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":7229, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.179140000000000298996383207850158214569091796875, "genres":["Games", "Puzzle", "Music", "Action"], "price":0.00, "trackId":839685715, "trackName":"Dino Fun - Dinosaurs!", "releaseDate":"2014-03-20T14:41:29Z", "genreIds":["6014", "7012", "6011", "7001"], "primaryGenreName":"Games", "primaryGenreId":6014, "sellerName":"Nancy Mossman", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-01-29T16:33:01Z", "releaseNotes":"Unlocked more dino fun flashcards so you can discover fascinating prehistoric facts.\nThanks for your support and feedback!", "version":"3.3", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Step back in time and explore the prehistoric world with Dino Fun – Dinosaurs!\n\nIf you or your budding palaeontologist love dinosaurs, this engaging app is packed with dino games, real facts, and interactive activities that make learning exciting and fun.\n\nDesigned by teachers in Canada with over 15 years of childcare experience, Dino Fun follows a learning-through-play approach that keeps children engaged while they discover fascinating facts about dinosaurs that once roamed our planet.\n\nWhether you’re exploring a Dino Park, collecting fossils, or cracking open dino eggs, Dino Fun – Dinosaurs combines education and entertainment in a way kids love.\n\nDinosaur Bone Collecting Game\nHelp the palaeontologist collect bones across six exciting dinosaur worlds!  Jump from platform to platform in fast-paced dino games set in fun themes like Jungle, Halloween, and Christmas. When enough bones are collected, they magically come together to form a dinosaur skeleton. Tap the completed skeleton to hear a fun fact about the dinosaur you helped build!  This action-packed Dino Fun game builds coordination, problem-solving, and cognitive skills while keeping kids entertained.\n\nDinosaur Flashcards\nDiscover over 30 different dinosaurs with interactive flashcards featuring:\n* Real-life images\n* Correct pronunciation of dinosaur names\n* Fossil visuals\n* Over 120 interesting dinosaur facts\nEach card includes easy-to-understand icons showing what the dinosaur ate, how big it was, when it lived, where its fossils were found, and one unique fun fact. These Dinosaur Games for Kids are perfect for curious minds who want to learn more about dinosaurs and dinosaurios in an engaging way.\n\nBONUS GAME – Dinosaur Fossil Quiz\nTest your knowledge after exploring the flashcards!  Match fossils to the correct dinosaurs by choosing from four options. This quiz is a fun way to reinforce learning and makes Dino Fun even more interactive.\n\nDino Egg Tapping Game\nAll dinosaurs hatched from eggs, and now kids can experience the fun of cracking them open! Choose an egg and tap it a certain number of times to make it crack. When it opens, a lively dinosaur animation appears, delighting kids while helping build number recognition and fine motor skills.\n\nDinosaur Dancing\nTap the dinosaurs and make them dance to fun, upbeat music!\nThis playful activity is perfect for little fingers that love to tap, tap, tap, and adds another layer of joy to Dino Fun – Dinosaurs.\n\nWhy Kids Love Dino Fun\n* Multiple dino games in one app\n* Real dinosaur facts presented in a kid-friendly way\n* Designed by educators\n* Encourages curiosity, learning, and imagination\n* Perfect for fans of Dino Park, dinosaurs, and dinosaurios\n\nTravel back to prehistoric times and enjoy hours of learning and play with Dino Fun – Dinosaurs! Where Dino Fun, dinosaurs, and education come together for a roaring good time", "bundleId":"com.deborahjmossman.DinosaurToddlerFeb2014IPHONE", "artistId":766398704, "artistName":"Nancy Mossman", "userRatingCount":7229}, 
