"description":"Jump into a virtual multiplayer world filled with many species of Jurassic era dinos. You can play online and hunt as epic dinosuars like the T-Rex, Spinosaur and Raptor! Can you become the strongest of the pack and survive in this simulator?\n\nHuge 3D Worlds to Explore.\n\nYou begin your adventure on the ancient island, and you can progress to an arctic world and even a volcano world!\n \nChoose Your Breed\n\nPlay as dangerous carnivores like T-Rex, Raptor and the Spinosaur! You can also play as plant-eating herbivoes such as the Triceratops and Iguanadon. Many epic monster dinosaurs to choose from, even babies and rare animals like the Wooly Mammoth and Saber Tooth Tiger!\n\nHunt Together in Packs\n\nBecome the ultimate predator as you team up with your carnivore friends and hunt bigger dinos together. The bigger dinosaur you hunt, the more you can level up your dino! Battle it out and see who is the strongest in the park!\n\nForm Alliances, Meet Friends & Chat\n\nMake friends with other players and chat to plan hunting and survival strategies!\n\nTons of Missions\n\nJoin an adventure to rescue dinosaurs as you hunt, search for food and shelter, and battle for survival.\n\nUpdates: Foxie Games are planning lots of stable updates to make the game even more fun.\n\nPlay for Free! You can play through the whole game without paying any real money! However, like all our games, Dino World Online is free to play, but it contains upgrades that can be purchased for real money.\n\nVisit our official website at www.foxiegames.com", "bundleId":"com.foxie.dwo", "artistId":922042387, "artistName":"AppForge Inc.", "userRatingCount":15091}, 
